      "message": "For the broadcom adapters, you may not need this method.  The Adtran ONU that I am currently using does not support the OMCI ME, so this is why I have it overloaded for my adapter.\n\nFor the T\u0026W, it does support the OMCI ME but only the get-supported-ME request.   Getting the supported message types returns a value with the right size, but the data contents are garbage.  I have not file a report with T\u0026W yet.\n\nSo for this, method, you may want to delete it if your ONU\u0027s work well.",
