      "writtenOn": "2018-07-23T15:12:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As mentioned above, the T\u0026W sends garbage back from this, so you may want to change the \u0027self._omci_managed\u0027 below to be.\n\nif vendor_id !\u003d TWSW:\n    return super(BcrmCapabilitiesTask, self).supported_message_types)",
